# CR 800.4b through ControlPlayerEffect.java (ADR-0030): human sacrifices
# Mindslaver in their turn 1 main phase targeting ai. Nothing changes that
# turn; control begins as ai's turn 2 begins (PhaseHandler.java:515-518).
# During that turn ai casts Coax from the Blind Eternities, a Wish over
# Origin$ Sideboard,Exile: a controlled player cannot search outside the
# game (ChangeZoneEffect.java:987-991), so only Exile is searched, it holds
# no Eldrazi, nothing is offered and Emrakul stays in the sideboard. Had
# Sideboard been searched, the unqueued card choice would fail the run.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets ai
queue action human activate 1 0
passpriority
# Main1 -> ai's turn 2 Main1: CombatBegin, DeclareAttackers,
# DeclareBlockers, FirstStrikeDamage, CombatDamage, CombatEnd, Main2, End,
# Cleanup, then ai's Untap, Upkeep, Draw (ai draws Id:11), Main1.
advance 13
tapformana ai 6 U
tapformana ai 7 U
tapformana ai 8 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
castspell ai 9
resolvestack
